abstract: >
Fieldglass® Runtime Evidence Observatory is the first
public Runtime Evidence™ instrument for AI interaction
systems. Released as part of the SubstrateX® Runtime
Evidence Infrastructure and grounded in Recursive
Science®, Fieldglass® transforms interaction logs,
operational traces, and agent workflows into observable,
replayable, challengeable, and preservable runtime
evidence. The platform supports runtime telemetry,
failure formation analysis, boundary analysis, role
topology, runtime replay, EvidenceCommons® artifacts,
and Runtime Evidence™ standards-aligned exports.

